FROM /v0.1.4/demos/local-llm/Dollyfile-pi-local 9cde1caa0ecf4394dc039d38d55ce078430bfe8eeca940eee18709bccebe859f
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/neovim/Dollyfile-nvim c7d15acb5e1384c8f1e9130cad129662641084288d2d120a227e88f7cf7849a1
REQUIRES TOOL pi
